---
description: How agents should scaffold new apps from the template
alwaysApply: false
---

When asked to scaffold a new app:

1. Copy `templates/nextjs/` into `apps/<app-name>/`.
2. Update the package name, page copy, and metadata for the new app.
3. Run `npm install` and `npm run build` in the new app.
4. Keep the starter app deployable on Vercel without additional infrastructure.
